Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-停下  -不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! Stop! Stop! - Not leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了炼狱  萨姆撞了狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to purgatory. Sam hit a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力抓走了你  我看到了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley kidnapped you. I saw that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你逃出来了  怎么逃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you escaped. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟克劳力说我要开启地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Crowley I was opening a hell gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我读的是另一个章节\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was reading from another chapter --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to destroy demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  妈妈  -凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, mom.  - Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位可爱的女士是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this lovely young thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我儿子远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了这个  看你们怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck closing the gates to hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}without this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-凯文  -开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin! - You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没了石碑  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Since we lost the tablet, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文觉得我们不需要他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin figures we don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但是克劳力有石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Crowley still does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是天使吗  你们为石碑而来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel? You're chasing the magic rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们负责保护神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We protect the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡没能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,推我  使劲儿推  高一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push me! Push me! Higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是手指画  亚伦  不是身体画\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's finger painting, Aaron, not body painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去洗干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:02:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(双松度假村 距此10公里)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来就像是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you've s--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想说  "你就像是活见鬼了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was gonna say, "You look like you've seen a ghost,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但很可能是嗨过头了  没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'd probably be stoked. Uh, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:25.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  有什么事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm cool. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子从幼儿园失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this kid went missing from a preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕  还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他失踪的同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the same time he vanished,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一场莫名的龙卷风来袭  持续了20秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}a surprise tornado hit, lasted maybe 20 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后又迅速消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, uh...shazam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风过天晴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to perfect weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有人藐视气候变化呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. And they pooh-pooh climate change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去几周内  同样的怪事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, similar wackiness has happened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在别处也时有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the past few weeks in other places --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在塔尔萨  一名巴士司机消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Tulsa, a bus driver vanishes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而河里挤满了青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a river gets overrun with frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新墨西哥州一名邮差失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Mexico -- a mailman disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地面塌陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the earth splits open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊  你觉得是恶魔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So, uh, you thinking demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  有可能  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, possibly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些事件发生的范围太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this stuff was major.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当事人没有任何相同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}These folks have nothing in common --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宗教信仰不同  家乡不同  年龄各异  \N{\fnArial\fs30}No religious affiliations, different hometowns, all ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么恶魔要抓走他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would demons want them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔想要什么都很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do demons want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去管吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, we on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把所有的名字都告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given you all the names.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对不对  根本不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No. And no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我想要听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.79,0:04:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起我  这个伤你更深\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hurts you more than it hurts me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我可以持续到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can go on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而对你而言  永远即意味着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, in your case, forever means...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天荒地老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等天使们发现你的所作所为后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the angels find out what you're doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样  把我撵走  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be what -- put out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好怕怕啊  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm quaking, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂的电网都已经彻底毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power grid is so whacked out in heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都没发现你失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't even know you're not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在数三下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, on the count of 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  二\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没数三呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说谎了  我常这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied. I do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把其他的名字都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the other names.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no other names!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一代还未出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next generation isn't born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话  就没理由继续折磨你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose there's no reason to keep torturing you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦开始  就很难收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you get going, it's really hard to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我把他看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him on ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从他嘴里我们只得到了皮毛而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only just scratched the surface with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望这个大厅里的喧闹不要太让你们烦心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope the ruckus down the hall wasn't too off-putting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的建筑标准跟宗教法庭时期可不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Construction standards aren't what they were during the Inquisition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.82,0:06:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没时间说细节了  那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No niceties. All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们肯定在想  我为何要召集一队杂牌军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you're wondering why I convened this motley group.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在我出门回来时都用圣水泼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to stop drowning me in holy water every time I go out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没被恶魔附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not possessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时没有而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们上了我的身  你忘了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got to me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有魔法袋  恶魔看不见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got hex bags that make us invisible to demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都画了恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got demon traps painted everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手臂上还纹了个魔符\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a sigil tattooed on my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不停地换地方  肯定没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we just keep moving, we'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续住在老鼠成灾的破屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, and keep living in rat-infested hovels
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:06:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时刻躲避着那些邪恶之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and running from cursed creatures?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这哪叫生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒霉当先知的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one dragging the prophet load.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我拖累了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I pulled you into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要抱歉  要做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be sorry. Be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须停止逃跑  开始反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to stop running and start taking a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是痴人说梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有你在克劳力的恶魔身上用过的炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we have the bomb you used on Crowley's demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找做那东西的材料得跑遍全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing I made had ingredients from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  派了一群恶魔才找齐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Demons had to get the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才找了专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I went to an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我雇了一个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hired a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-巫师  广告网站上找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A witch? - Off of craigslist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫黛尔塔·梅朵塔  聪明伶俐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Delta Mendota, and she is a smart cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有斗志  靠得住  不怕杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's scrappy, reliable, and she's willing to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我是你妈  我做这些都是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm your mother, and I did this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么认定她可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think you can trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.47,0:07:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不信她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我没有告诉她准确的用量\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I didn't give her the exact quantities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及怎样混合\N{\fnArial\fs30}or tell her how to blend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉她我们在做恶魔炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told her we were making demon bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  这让她变得特别积极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and that got her super motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黛尔塔汇报进度的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Time for Delta to check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  谭夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mrs. Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  黛尔塔  我们说正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Delta. Bring us up to speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西备齐了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got all the stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你不打算告诉我炸弹配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you'd tell me the recipe for these bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"随遇"  意思就是你不可以问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Casual encounters." That means no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈  那是另一条广告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, mom, that's another part of craigslist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:38.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做巫师多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全职巫师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乐队解散之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the band broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还参加过乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in a band?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对待巫术生意非常认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take my witch business real serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会全力以赴  一定是最棒的巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it, and it's gonna be wicked awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏甲夫人吗  探员罗斯和马洛伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hagar? Mm-hmm. Agents Roth and Malloy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想跟你谈谈亚伦·韦伯绑架案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to speak to you about Aaron Webber's abduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都跟警察说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前一秒我正带亚伦去洗手\N{\fnArial\fs30}one minute I was taking Aaron to get cleaned up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在三个街区之外的停车场醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up in a park three blocks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完全不记得发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have no memory of what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他就那样失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He was just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能想到有什么人想伤害他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think any reason why somebody would want to harm him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人  他才五岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemies? He's 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[拉丁语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你的安全使用的代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, code for your own safety
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保证你不会在强化审讯时泄露信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that you can't reveal anything under enhanced interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您醒来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when you woke up on the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周围有打斗的痕迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}were there any signs of struggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell like sulfur?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜测而已  多谢您的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess. Thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对驱魔咒无反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reaction to the exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  现在没有被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not possessed at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我敢打赌亚伦·韦伯在恶魔手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm willing to bet a demon got ahold of Aaron Webber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(突发风暴  一名儿童失踪)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有之前在路边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and -- and earlier, on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出来了  他没能出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it out and he didn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我费尽力气就想让大家一起出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried so damn hard to get us the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我本可以把他拉出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could have pulled him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不明白他为什么不再加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand why he didn't try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did everything you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  可是为什么我还这么难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why do I feel like crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸存者的内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivor's guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你放任不管  它会一直折磨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you let it, this is gonna keep messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须从内疚中走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to walk past it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  我什么也看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I don't see crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个出口到底长什么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell is this escape hatch supposed to look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我刀山火海一路走到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you just drug me through the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托给个准话  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you know. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:38.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它就在这  他们保证的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here. They promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们  真让人放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they? Well, that's comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便它真的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, even if it does exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚问过了  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broken record, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这是一条人类通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's a human portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有证据显示天使能够通过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still no proof that an angel can pass --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍着吧  小卡  你非来不可  就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stow it, Cass. You're coming. That's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it doesn't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}...thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把标记留住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the hallmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会成功的 不会有谁被落下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna work. Nobody gets left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望这里的橙汁和薄煎饼还符合你们的口味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you enjoyed our orange juice and pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种碳水化合物最好是早餐吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to pack in those carbs in the morning, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们是在太空飞船上吗  -你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we on a spaceship? - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们从家里  从亲人身边劫走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snapping us up from our homes, our families,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后传送到这艘母舰上\N{\fnArial\fs30}teleporting us to this m-mother ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-母舰  -你们是外星人  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mother ship? - You're aliens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这话大概问了也白问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认识这个东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识汉字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't read Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人还真是日渐低级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about the dumbing down of America.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人认识吗  很有意思的  试试嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone? Come on. It's fun. Give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这群笨蛋完全不知道这是什么对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hapless toads are utterly clueless, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家里还有老婆孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I got a wife and kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一堆账单要付  工作耽误不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I got bills. I can't miss work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-先生  -我有自己的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - I got rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是可以打一个电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my one phone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁想发牢骚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else want to complain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我们保存着这个..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We hold this..."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是"这些"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, maybe "these."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"真相..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"...truths to be..."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好认多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's better, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  你叫凯文是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Kevin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I was -- ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我妈  你们见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my mother, you've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西你都准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然  虽说挺难搞  不过还是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet. It was a bitch, but so worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  那群恶魔不把我当人看  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I am sick of being treated like dirt 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by those demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁死了之后他们就成大王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, who died and made them boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能真的有人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, probably somebody did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他们那种蛮横的态度真该收敛一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they could use a serious attitude reduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小凯  卫生间在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev, where's the ladies room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开了很久的车  还被你妈...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long drive, and, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在那边  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over there. - Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黛尔塔  这是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说得很清楚  我要建一座军火库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was clear. I need to build an arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也就顶多算是一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This maybe gets me one weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你付我全款之后  我再把剩下的货交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a little taste of what you'll get when I get paid in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:38.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当初可不是这么约定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not the agreement!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不仅有美国人失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so it's not just Americans who are vanishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个家伙  叫路易吉·庞氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this guy, Luigi Ponzi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在罗马地铁的两节车厢之间走着走着就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappeared walking between two subway cars in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而在地面之上发生了雹暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right above ground, there was a freak hail storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去罗马吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we going to Rome?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了  伙计  我简直不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable, man. I-I cannot believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的就在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're actually here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:29.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我一直想跟你们联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've been trying to reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不知什么原因  我的能量不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for whatever reason, I wasn't at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以联系不上你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I couldn't connect with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才一直看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must have been why you kept seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, I got to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想你到底是怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I'm thinking, how the hell did you make it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也去过那里  我了解那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I -- I was there. I-I-I know that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道要不断地挣扎探索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how we had to scratch and claw 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要杀戮流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill and bleed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到那个通道并穿越过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find that portal and make it through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了出来差点送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it almost finished me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是怎么活着出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how exactly are you sitting here with us right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你刚才所说的一点都没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, everything you just said is completely true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这正是奇怪之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the strange part.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只记得不停地奔跑  躲避利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember endlessly running and hiding from Leviathan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就出现在了伊利诺伊州的一条公路旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I was on the side of the road in Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that -- that was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身上很脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I'm dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  在炼狱待过确实会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, purgatory will do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你被骗了  根本就没有裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you were lied to. Maybe there is no seam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我骗别人  没人骗得了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lie. I don't get lied to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们难道不是信心满满吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you guys all about faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算不上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡事还是要有信心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ye of frigging little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那边  它在对你做出回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is. It's reacting to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗  就像我们之前说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Ready? Just like we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可全靠你了  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting a lot of trust in you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那边再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:20:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看出这事相当不对劲了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do see something severely wrong here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  离开那个鬼地方的过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I remember every second 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}of leaving that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.23,0:20:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得那种灼热  恶臭  疼痛  恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I remember the heat, the stink, the pain, the fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个痛苦的经历都留在我脑海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have that whole ugly mess right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.59,0:20:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可他却说不记得是怎么出来的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he says he has no idea how he got out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I'm just not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你觉得他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think he's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是肯定有别的事情发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying something else happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他当时那种虚弱的状态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the shape that he was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他不可能靠自己一人杀出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there was no way he was fighting his ass out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁或什么帮他逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who or what got him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你这个小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you little skank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在服务行业\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the service industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是先到货才付款\N{\fnArial\fs30}you always deliver the goods, then you get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连妓女都懂这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even hookers know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹就是妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, my sister's a hooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以妓女先拿到钱  然后才交货\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hookers get paid first, and then you get the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正没有恶魔来追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not the one with demons on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想反悔我们的交易  我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to renege on our deal, it's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  把我的钱包拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, bring me my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈一定为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother must be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然和我妹妹一起  酒吧生意不是很火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, with my sister, the bar ain't real high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈  是你把储藏室窗户边的盐线破开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Did you break the salt line by the store-room window?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别白费劲了  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't bother, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们跑不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  黛尔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Delta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:21:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:22:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.07,0:22:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很随机善变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm mercurial.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕黛尔塔会觉得你是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid Delta found you to be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难相处又不领情的雇主  谭女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}a difficult and ungrateful employer, Mrs. Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她觉得如果和我谈生意的话会赚得更多一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}She felt she'd gain far more leverage by negotiating with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, after all, the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.03,0:22:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你只是位母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我表现得很好  对吧  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did good, didn't I, your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.53,0:22:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, very.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒昧的愚弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presumptuous twit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  把我抓走  放了我儿子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Take me. Leave my son alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓你  我抓你有什么用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? What would I do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她  毁了做咒语用的材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her. Destroy the makings for the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.41,0:22:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要  -和老妈说再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Yes. Say goodbye to mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.26,0:23:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the latest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么新消息也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像一切都停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like it all stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何与离奇的自然事件有关的离奇失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No freak disappearances linked to any freak natural events.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么现在有多少人失踪了  七个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how many have we got, seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  路易吉  贾斯汀  亚伦  玛丽亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, Luigi, Justin, Aaron, Maria...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.24,0:23:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽亚  丹尼斯  克里斯塔  斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria, Dennis, Krista, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想念电视机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed television.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  小卡  你怎么知道那些人名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Cass. How did you know those are the names?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.29,0:23:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们都是先知  -先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, they're prophets. - Prophets?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  天使天生就知道所有先知的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, angels instinctively know the names of every prophet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去的  现在的还有将来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}past, present, and future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这是所有现存的先知的名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this list is the name of every one of them that exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.63,0:23:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  直到下一代诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, until the next generation is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然还有凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus Kevin Tran, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.47,0:23:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于一个时段内只能存在一个先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other seven are future prophets,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外那七个是未来的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since, uh, only one can exist at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然恰克是先知  凯文怎么也是先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Kevin a prophet if Chuck is a prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚恰克怎么了  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what happened to Chuck, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he must be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:23:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果凯文死了就会有下一个来接班\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the next one comes off the bench if Kevin goes down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:23:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.72,0:24:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然他们不知道自己的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they have no idea who they are, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.09,0:24:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.93,0:24:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保险起见  他要绝望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insurance. boy, he's getting desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.48,0:24:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能解释所有的离奇现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explains all the weird phenomena.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低等恶魔能劫持重型货船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower-level demons nabbing heavy-duty cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.23,0:24:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神之语的躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vessels of God's Word...Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到有事情要发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the feeling something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.27,0:24:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谭夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Tran?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.05,0:24:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where the hell have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.93,0:24:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.97,0:24:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力抓走了凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's got Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  正如你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Kevin, as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.19,0:24:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间的关系现在更明了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}our relationship is much simpler now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.51,0:24:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么帮我  要么就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either help me, or you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.39,0:24:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后这些人中就会有人接你的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of these fine specimens takes your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太明白你为什么还要犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't quite understand your hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.64,0:24:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚杀了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just killed my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.31,0:24:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.34,0:24:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她也在策划杀我和我的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to be fair, she was plotting to kill me and my kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.59,0:24:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.42,0:25:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以和你这样勇敢的小伙子做一笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do a great deal for a plucky lad like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.89,0:25:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一旦读出了石碑你就会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll just kill me as soon as I read the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.47,0:25:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的年轻人都这么愤世嫉俗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are all young people so horribly cynical?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.44,0:25:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我很沮丧  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depresses me, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.26,0:25:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.79,0:25:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想让你读出这块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really want you to read the tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.60,0:25:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为坦白地说  这东西很没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, frankly, this lot fail to inspire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而  俗话说得好  \N{\fnArial\fs30}However, better a stupid prophet 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.88,0:25:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做头蠢驴也别做倔驴\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a stubborn prophet, as the saying goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选择当哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.96,0:25:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你怀疑我不是动真格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you doubt that I'm serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.62,0:26:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.22,0:26:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近读过什么好的石碑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read any good tablets lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.87,0:26:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.56,0:26:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,96英里标志牌应该在公路的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, mile marker 96 was kind of the halfway point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要赶快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.56,0:27:11.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通道要关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The portal's closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.94,0:27:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Damn it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.62,0:27:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.02,0:27:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.03,0:27:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓住你了  坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.83,0:27:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.01,0:27:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.45,0:27:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.52,0:27:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  出去聊两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, can I talk to you outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.41,0:27:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:27:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.72,0:28:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在炼狱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there. Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了要带你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I would get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.38,0:28:05.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都快成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你似乎就那么放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like you just gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像不相信我们可以出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you didn't believe we could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先前就一直在说  我们这样是徒劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you kept saying that you didn't think it would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:14.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not trust me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.07,0:28:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -为了把你救出来  我尽了全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean... - I did everything I could to get you out -- everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.39,0:28:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.42,0:28:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这是你的错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think this was your fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.03,0:28:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能帮忙  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.66,0:28:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能救他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.80,0:28:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力是怎么找到你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Crowley find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我雇了个巫师  她出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hired a witch, and she ratted us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.86,0:28:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A witch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.24,0:28:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要雇巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you hire a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.59,0:28:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是为了制作恶魔炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make demon bombs, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.21,0:29:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是凯文的笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Kevin's notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能想到克劳力带他去哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea where Crowley took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.06,0:29:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.21,0:29:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙也许知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy might.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.17,0:29:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.28,0:29:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人少一点  你大概更愿意开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought privacy might make it easier to chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.59,0:29:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候决定了  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decision time, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.93,0:29:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's this going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要顽抗  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be recalcitrant, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.42,0:29:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我这脾气又要使坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it brings out the worst in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.82,0:29:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.90,0:30:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.54,0:30:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是"恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next is... "The demonic influence
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.37,0:30:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对灵魂之毯的影响"\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the collective tapestry of the soul."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.39,0:30:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全是废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意就没人整理过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't anyone ever edit this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.80,0:30:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止  神写的东西真没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, as a writer, God's a snooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.99,0:30:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计是聚会不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fun at parties, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.68,0:30:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"流放到地狱的恶魔囚犯"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, "Demonic transport to the regions of hell."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.94,0:30:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说点我不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.84,0:30:33.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要宏观上的  这些太鸡毛蒜皮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think macro. This is stupefyingly micro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.09,0:30:37.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多宏观  -改变游戏规则的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How macro? - Game changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  谭夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Mrs. Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.37,0:30:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.48,0:31:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.68,0:31:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.92,0:31:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son is in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以克劳力已经很不好对付了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means Crowley already has leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.03,0:31:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不需要再来一个人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't need another hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.21,0:31:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.33,0:31:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.73,0:31:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激怒我  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't provoke me, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.65,0:31:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还剩九根手指头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have nine fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}This section has to do
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.62,0:31:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与针对恶魔的防卫性武器有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}with building defensive weapons against demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.46,0:31:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你肯定很熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. You're familiar with that one, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.71,0:31:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一部分...说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one... describes...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}sealing the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.87,0:31:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说是真的  就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's true. It's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.82,0:32:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很显然  人类不能拥有这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, humans cannot possess this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神是怎么想的  回头仔细看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was god thinking? We'll get back to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.33,0:32:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就到有趣的部分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just getting to the sexy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.74,0:32:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我往那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll check that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.56,0:32:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.51,0:32:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个不同  不是信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different. It's -- it's not text.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.76,0:32:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是私人笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a personal note?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神的笔记吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A personal note from god?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.60,0:33:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}From... the archangel...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.53,0:33:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.00,0:33:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scribe...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.54,0:33:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马屁精\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and suck-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.64,0:33:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录神的口谕  以及帮神擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took down god's word, picked up his cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.95,0:33:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是告别的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a farewell note.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.36,0:33:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.83,0:33:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"等这一任务完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Upon completion of this task,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.25,0:33:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就告别主人和这个世界"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take my leave of my master and this world."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.11,0:33:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.87,0:33:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你们注意到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you guys got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.11,0:34:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very near Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.94,0:34:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.10,0:34:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.86,0:34:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.72,0:34:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.39,0:34:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有完全恢复  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not all the way back, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.83,0:34:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"因此不再记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}"So ends the transcription
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.31,0:35:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维护人类的神谕\N{\fnArial\fs30}"of the sacred word for the defense of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由神之子的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Into the hands of god's children
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传递石碑目录"\N{\fnArial\fs30}thus passes the compendium of tablets."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.12,0:35:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-目录  -就是指有一系列的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Compendium? - It's a collection of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.74,0:35:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是指有系统有顺序的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially one systematically organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.82,0:35:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂这词的意思  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what "Compendium" means, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.33,0:35:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does Metatron mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.88,0:35:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.00,0:35:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.88,0:35:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  小卡  你不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, no. You're not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.05,0:35:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有碑文\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more tablets?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是利维坦和恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than "Leviathan" And "Demon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.53,0:35:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.17,0:35:43.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚从炼狱回来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.33,0:35:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该先打个电话嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd called first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.48,0:35:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.63,0:35:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是哪个卡西迪奥  我总是搞不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which Castiel is it this time? I'm never sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.59,0:35:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯子  还是自大狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madman or megalomaniac?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.26,0:35:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文要跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin is coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.21,0:35:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先知在我这边玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prophet's playing on my team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.34,0:36:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以只能这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is how it's gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.27,0:36:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.27,0:36:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常像《西区故事》  但是我们都理智点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all very West Side Story, but let's be logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.54,0:36:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很糟  我应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like hell, and I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.83,0:36:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你并没有准备好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.27,0:36:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你能点燃  但是你无法保持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can get it up, but you can't keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.05,0:36:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.27,0:36:37.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想冒险一试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to take that chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.15,0:37:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察很快就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.38,0:37:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要接上先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna pick up the prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都会直接回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, they'll all be heading home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.57,0:37:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打电话叫了我们的朋友  盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called a friend of ours, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.66,0:37:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和我们一样处理这些事  \N{\fnArial\fs30}He does what we do. 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.91,0:37:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是他有自己的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...in his own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.47,0:37:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会照顾你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll keep an eye on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.99,0:37:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再独自行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more going off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.09,0:37:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是因为雇了那个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that it was hiring that witch
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才让你们卷入这一切的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got you into all this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.68,0:37:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  还撑得住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up, Kev?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.20,0:37:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.37,0:37:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要把这些混蛋永远封住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to seal those bastards up forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.19,0:37:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍了我的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡认为他也许有办法治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass thinks he might be able to fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.10,0:37:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在此期间保持低调  等我们再来找你  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, just lay low till we get back to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.28,0:37:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚你那么做真是笨蛋一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a bonehead move back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.51,0:37:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会把自己害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have gotten yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.85,0:37:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.83,0:37:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没死  而且方法有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't get killed. And it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.29,0:37:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没效果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.26,0:37:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have been my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.23,0:37:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not the way I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.85,0:37:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一切事情都需要你负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everything isn't your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.07,0:38:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我带出炼狱也不是你的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting me out of purgatory wasn't your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.39,0:38:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没能出来  那是谁的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't get out. So whose fault was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.29,0:38:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这无关对错  都是意志问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about fault. It's about will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你真的不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, do you really not remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我在那里呆过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived it, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.90,0:38:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嘛  我知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.99,0:38:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你以为你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.57,0:38:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实只是以你需要的方式记忆而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remembered it the way you needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.57,0:38:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要因为遗弃你而感到痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't need to feel like hell for failing you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.05,0:38:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗弃你就像是失去了每一件我在乎的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}For failing you like I've failed every other godforsaken thing that I care about!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.41,0:38:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Just look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.61,0:38:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.88,0:38:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  该死  加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Damn it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.47,0:38:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.38,0:38:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓住你了  坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.45,0:38:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.64,0:38:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.69,0:38:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.78,0:39:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吧  并不是因为我当时太虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, it wasn't that I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.94,0:39:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时比你还强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.23,0:39:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挣脱开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.14,0:39:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么也没办法救下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you could have done would have saved me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.86,0:39:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我根本不想被拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't want to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.67,0:39:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.07,0:39:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我属于那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where I belonged.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要苦行赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to do penance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.00,0:39:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我在人间和天堂所做的一切之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the things I did on earth and in heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.86,0:39:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不配离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't deserve to be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.65,0:39:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在里面的时候就清楚认识到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw that clearly when I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.92,0:39:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我计划一直待在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I planned to stay all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.37,0:39:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不知道要如何告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't know how to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.36,0:39:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友  你不可能救下所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save everyone, my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.96,0:39:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管  你一直努力着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though, you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.06,0:40:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.70,0:40:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是  把一些事情说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh... setting a few things straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.08,0:40:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  盖思会低调地...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Garth is gonna lay low with the tra...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.09,0:40:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.20,0:40:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.21,0:40:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.12,0:40:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在家里  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're home, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.38,0:40:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.24,0:40:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多少天使来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.05,0:40:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.10,0:40:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.61,0:40:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.55,0:40:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派天使入侵  这让我们失去了不少生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}An incursion of angels, which cost us many lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.45,0:40:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们的对话当做是你的报答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider these chats your repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.01,0:40:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.52,0:40:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我说说萨姆和迪恩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先知现在很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prophet is being kept safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.43,0:40:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石碑裂成了两块\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablet has split in two
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.07,0:40:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特兄弟试图找回丢失的那块\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Winchesters are trying to recover the missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.36,0:40:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要告诉你这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I telling you any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.43,0:41:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要你操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.71,0:41:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮助温彻斯特兄弟  他们找你就出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help the Winchesters, come when they call.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.24,0:41:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要定期向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will report in to me regularly,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.17,0:41:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你永远不会记得你这么做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will never remember having done so.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.00,0:41:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  不会记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.78,0:41:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.69,0:41:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都不会注意你消失了一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't even notice you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.69,0:41:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找另外一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}...track down the other piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.95,0:41:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这次会帮我们的  小卡  对吧  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with us on this one, right, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.45,0:41:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.70,0:41:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.72,0:41:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我帮你们  如果没问题的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, I'm with you -- if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.93,0:41:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.64,0:41:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are good?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.23,0:41:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
